# Blog post frontmatter

Every file in `docs/writing/posts/` except `index.md` needs:

```yaml
---
authors:
  - nam
categories:
  - Notes
comments: false
date: YYYY-MM-DD
description: One or two sentences.
draft: false
slug: url-friendly-slug
tags:
  - tag
---
```

Then an `#` title, an excerpt, `<!-- more -->`, and the rest of the post.

New authors must be added to `docs/writing/.authors.yml` before they appear
in `authors`.
